Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 23:58:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05386/11362] [outer-loop] switch conductor planner/retro model
 from Claude Opus 4.8 to Sonnet 5

Edited ~/.config/systemd/user/carnot-conductor.service.d/10-gemini-routing.conf:
AGENT_MODEL_PLANNER/AGENT_MODEL_RETRO changed from claude-opus-4-8 to
claude-sonnet-5. AGENT_TYPE_PLANNER/AGENT_TYPE_RETRO unchanged (claude).
daemon-reload + restart carnot-conductor.service; verified via
systemctl --user show -p Environment.

Updated the one ACTIVE CLAUDE.md reference (Codex-Default-v2's planner/
retro exception) to reflect the new model. Left historical/retired-section
references to Opus 4.8 untouched per never-prune -- they're accurate
records of past state, not live instructions.

Scoped to the explicit ask: AGENT_MODEL_AUDIT (milestone-close adversarial
audits) still defaults to claude-opus-4-8 (hardcoded in
research_conductor.py:108, no env override) -- unchanged unless a separate
directive extends the switch there.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
